                <head>No. 826<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>On November 2, H.C. Hansen, Foreign Minister of Denmark, attended a luncheon
                    hosted by Secretary Dulles at Blair House. No record of a conversation has been
                    found in Department of State files.</p>
                <p>Halvard Lange, Foreign Minister of Norway, visited Secretary Dulles on November
                    15 to discuss the forthcoming Bermuda Conference and NAC meetings and certain
                    aspects of the proceedings at the United Nations, which Lange was then
                    attending. A brief <pb facs="0684" n="1774" xml:id="pg1774"/> record of this
                    conversation, dated November 16, is in file 757.13/111653.</p>
            </div>
